WEBVTT

00:00:56.580 --> 00:01:02.863
Last year, the person who did it
lost control of the crowd,

00:01:02.887 --> 00:01:05.155
and the precious metal traders,

00:01:05.179 --> 00:01:07.155
some of them got up
with their bread rolls

00:01:07.179 --> 00:01:09.186
and threw them onstage."

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:11.241
AG: They threw rolls at the presenter?

00:01:11.265 --> 00:01:12.612
ME: They did.

00:01:12.636 --> 00:01:14.616
AG: Ugh! Where they at least soft rolls?

00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:16.101
ME: They were soft rolls.

00:01:16.125 --> 00:01:18.442
AG: If someone tells you
your audience is drunk

00:01:18.466 --> 00:01:20.253
and might pelt you with food,

00:01:20.277 --> 00:01:22.386
you should probably call a cab.

00:01:22.410 --> 00:01:25.727
But Mohamed, who's jittery
even when things are going well,

00:01:25.751 --> 00:01:28.030
who overprepares for everything,

00:01:28.054 --> 00:01:29.696
did something different.

00:01:29.720 --> 00:01:31.482
ME: I went onstage and said,